%%{ init: { 'theme': 'dark' } }%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant RL as Rate Limiter
    participant AUTH as JWT Auth
    participant DET as Deterministic<br/>Stage (<20ms)
    participant CACHE as Redis Cache
    participant OPA as OPA Policies<br/>(<30ms)
    participant ENS as Ensemble<br/>Decision
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant LLM as LLM Judge<br/>(Async)
    participant REM as Remediation
    participant AUD as Audit Trail

    C->>RL: POST /api/pipeline/detect
    RL->>AUTH: Rate check passed
    AUTH->>DET: JWT validated

    Note over DET: 33 compiled regex<br/>NonBacktracking<br/>Email, Phone, SSN,<br/>CC (Luhn), Injection,<br/>Credentials

    DET->>DET: Pattern matching

    alt Critical violation found (confidence ≥ 0.95)
        DET->>REM: Fast-path BLOCK
        REM->>AUD: Log decision
        AUD->>C: 200 {decision: "block", timings: {det: 12ms}}
    else No critical — check cache
        DET->>CACHE: Check L1 (memory) → L2 (Redis)
        alt Cache hit
            CACHE-->>ENS: Cached OPA result
        else Cache miss
            DET->>OPA: Evaluate 6 policy packages
            OPA-->>CACHE: Store result (5min TTL)
            OPA-->>ENS: Violations + decisions
        end

        ENS->>ENS: Weighted scoring

        alt Confidence ≥ 0.85 — auto-approve
            ENS->>REM: Decision: allow/redact
        else Confidence < 0.70 — needs LLM
            ENS->>MQ: Queue for LLM judge
            MQ->>LLM: Async processing
            ENS->>REM: Preliminary: escalate
            Note over LLM: 5 prompt templates<br/>PII, Security,<br/>Compliance, Safety, Brand
            LLM-->>AUD: Async update with LLM result
        else 0.70–0.85 — borderline
            ENS->>REM: Decision: escalate to human
        end

        REM->>AUD: Log with hash chain
        AUD->>C: 200 {decision, confidence, violations, timings}
    end
